   "signature": "function parseMetadataDoc(\n  doc: MetadataText,\n  opts: ParseMetadataDocOptions = {},\n): ParsedMetadataDoc",
   "doc": "Read a record's document without trusting it and without fetching\nanything:\n\n- at most 3,072 bytes, strict UTF-8, `JSON.parse`, a JSON object;\n- `name` and `symbol`: text, equal to the record's (`opts`) when given;\n- `description`: text (over 500 bytes is a warning);\n- `image`: only `data:image/png;base64,…` (canonical base64) of a\n  well-formed PNG (`pngInfo`) of at most 64x64 pixels;\n- links (`external_url`, `extensions.x`, `extensions.telegram`): inert\n  text with the host spelled out; an unusable link is dropped with a\n  warning; unknown keys are ignored with a warning, as is a document not\n  in the canonical form `buildMetadataDoc` writes (other readers may show\n  a document with repeated keys differently).\n\nA part with a problem is null in the result; `ok` is false.",
   "notes": "Reads a document without trusting it and without fetching anything: size cap, strict UTF-8, `JSON.parse`, an object; `image` only `data:image/png;base64,` (canonical base64) of a well-formed PNG of at most 64x64; links are inert text with their host spelled out (unusable ones dropped with a warning); a name or symbol other than the record's is a problem; a document not in the canonical form is a warning. Show a part only when it is not null.",
   "deprecated": false,
