   "doc": "Check a document's parts before building it: name 1..=32 and symbol\n1..=10 bytes (the record's own), a description of at most 500 bytes, a\nPNG icon of at most 64x64, `https://` links (X and Telegram to their own\nhosts), no unpaired UTF-16 surrogate, and the whole document at most\n3,072 bytes. Every problem as `\"field: message\"`.",
   "notes": "The document: compact JSON, keys in the fixed order `name, symbol, description, image, external_url, extensions{x, telegram}`, empty parts left out, the icon as `data:image/png;base64,…` (a PNG of at most 64x64), `https://` links (X and Telegram to their own hosts), a description of at most 500 bytes, at most 3,072 bytes in all. The same input gives the same bytes.",
