   "signature": "function burnReasons(i: BurnReasonInput): BurnReason[]",
   "doc": "Every reason the program would have had to burn this landing's leaf\nwithout attesting (`attest_launch`: the attestation slot must be free\n(empty, or another message's whose window passed), the key the launch's\nidentity, the metadata record must exist and the window must have at\nleast 60 s left), from what is known. Empty when none can be inferred.",
   "notes": "`attested` only when the attestation holds this message's hash; `burned` (with `reasons`: `record-missing`, `rules-missing`, `invalid-window`, `wrong-identity`, `already-attested`) when the leaf was used without attesting; `pending` when nothing landed. Never assume a landing attested.",
