   "doc": "The signatures of `launch` the ledger holds that were never seen landing\n(their leaf is clear on-chain) and whose window has not ended: each could\nstill land (review info #2), and `landingNow` says what that would do now.\nReads the launch, its attestation, the identity's bitmap and the records\nthe signatures name. Empty when nothing is pending.",
   "notes": "The launch's signatures the ledger holds that were never seen landing with a known outcome and whose window has not ended on both the cluster's clock and this device's, each with `window`, `windowIso`, `leaf`, `messageHash`, `leafSetOnChain` and `landingNow`: `attests` (it would take the slot and set the opening time to its window) or `burns`.",
