   "group": "pq-vault",
   "signature": "function exportVaultKeyRecords(\n  ledger: VaultKeyLedger,\n  opts: { readonly vault?: PublicKey | undefined } = {},\n): Promise<VaultKeyLedgerExport>",
   "doc": "The signed records of `ledger` (of one vault with `opts.vault`), for\n`importVaultKeyRecords` on another device that holds the same phrase,\nBEFORE that device signs (see \"Several devices\" in the module docs).\nA signed record without its key (SDK 0.2.0) cannot be carried: it is\nlisted in `skipped` (`no-key`), which the importer reports as\n`unverifiable`; run `completeVaultKeyRecords` first so that it is not.\nThrows `VaultLedgerError` when a record cannot be parsed.",
   "notes": "Several devices holding one phrase: export the signed records on the device that signed, import them on the other one BEFORE it signs. An import is authenticated and only adds; it reports keys given to two withdrawals (`conflicts`), keys holding two signatures (`compromised`: broadcast one of the two at once) and keys the other device signed with but could not export (`unverifiable`: do not sign here while it is not empty).",
