   "doc": "Parse and validate a withdraw message (length, tag, op, program id).",
   "notes": "The 185-byte message and the low-level signer (the same checks, on private copies; refuses when `key.skSeed` changes meanwhile). Prefer `prepareWithdrawal`.",
