   "doc": "The deterministic randomizer `C` of a withdrawal signature:\n`HMAC-SHA256(SEED, \"phalanx/pq/lmots/C\" || I || u32be(q) || msg)`\n(`noised_lmots::PrivateKey::randomizer`).",
