   "doc": "`Plan::max_tip`: the most the run's tip may be: `TIP_LAMPORTS`, or for a\npartial buyback its share `TIP_LAMPORTS * amountIn / p1` (audit 4, A4-2),\nso the partial runs of one node run together earn less than one tip.",
