   "module": "programmable/autopilot/logic",
   "group": "autopilot-logic",
   "signature": "function planValue(p: RunPlan, burnPriceSqrtQ64: bigint, kept: bigint = 0n): bigint",
   "doc": "`Plan::value`: what the run moved in lamports (its tip is a share of it):\nlamports swapped; tokens burned at `burnPriceSqrtQ64` (`burnPrice`: 0\nbefore graduation, after it the lower of the reference and the lowest\nobserved price; audit 4, A4-4); lamports paid, i.e. the shares less the\n`kept` ones of recipients that had no wSOL account (audit 4, M4).",
   "notes": "",
